*.xlsx

# Experiment runtime outputs (fixtures/scripts stay tracked)
experiments/results/**
!experiments/results/README.md
!experiments/results/*_scores.json
!experiments/results/*_summary.json
!experiments/results/CHAIN_OF_CUSTODY.json

